:: Bike Depot Lock

<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<set $lock to 0>>

<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte $lock>>
	<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
		You think you'd be able to pick the lock, <span class="blue">if your arms weren't bound.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<wearProp "lockpick">>
		<span class="green">The lock looks easy to pick.</span>
		<br><br>

		<<lockicon "pick">><<link [[Pick it (0:10)|Bike Depot]]>><<pass 10>><<crimeUp 5 "trespassing">><</link>><<crime "trespassing">>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">The lock looks beyond your ability to pick.</span>
	<<skulduggeryrequired>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Shopping Centre]]>><</link>>

:: Bike Depot
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "shopping_centre">><<effects>>

You are in the Bike Depot. It has a quite the stock of bikes.
<br><br>
<<if $phase is 5>>
	You purchase a repair kit, making your current carried amount <span class="yellow"><<print $bicycle.durability.repair>></span>. You <<if $bicycle.durability.repair lt 5>>think you can carry <<print (5 - $bicycle.durability.repair)>><<else>> can't carry<</if>> more.
	<br><br>
	<<set $phase to 0>>
<<elseif $phase is 4>>
	<<switch $bicycle.quality>>
		<<case 3>>
			<<set _repairAmount to 12000 / 4>>
			<<set $bicycle.durability.current to Math.min($bicycle.durability.current + _repairAmount, 12000)>>
		<<case 2>>
			<<set _repairAmount to 6000 / 4>>
			<<set $bicycle.durability.current to Math.min($bicycle.durability.current + _repairAmount, 6000)>>
		<<case 1>>
			<<set _repairAmount to 3000 / 4>>
			<<set $bicycle.durability.current to Math.min($bicycle.durability.current + _repairAmount, 3000)>>
		<<default>>
	<</switch>>
	Your bike has been given a tune-up, restoring _repairAmount minutes of usage time.
	<br><br>
	<<set $phase to 0>><<unset _repairAmount>>
<<elseif $phase is 3>>
	Your high-end bike has been purchased and put outside of the shopping centre.
	<br><br>
	<<set $phase to 0>>
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	Your intermediate bike has been purchased and put outside of the shopping centre.
	<br><br>
	<<set $phase to 0>>
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	Your basic bike has been purchased and put outside of the shopping centre.
	<br><br>
	<<set $phase to 0>>
<</if>>

<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	You are alone in the darkness.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>
	You hide behind a rack of bikes to protect your dignity.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutshop>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.hour is 21>>
		It's closing time. Security is herding everyone outside.
		<<if $exposed gte 1>>
			Panic swells within you as you realise how embarrassed you'll be should security find you exposed like this.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $exposed lte 0>>
			<<highicon>><<link [[Go outside|High Street]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<ind>><<link [["Hide until it's over (1:00)"|Bike Depot]]>><<pass 1 hour>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if Time.dayState is "night" and Time.hour isnot 21 and !$weekly.theft.bikeDepot>>
			<<shopicon "register">><<link [[Examine the cash register|Bike Depot Register]]>><</link>>
			<br><br>
		<<elseif $exposed lte 0 and Time.dayState isnot "night" and Time.hour isnot 21>>
			<<if $bicycle.quality lt 3>>
				<<if $money gte 250000>>
					<<bikeicon>><<link [[Purchase a high-end bike (£2500 0:05)|Bike Depot]]>><<pass 5>><<set $phase to 3>><<set $bicycle.quality to 3>><<set $bicycle.durability.current to 12000>><<set $bicycle.durability.max to $bicycle.durability.current>><<set $bicycle.location to "high">><<set $money -= 250000>><</link>>
				<<else>>
					<span class="red">You don't have the £2500 to purchase a high-end bike.</span>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $bicycle.quality is 3 && $bicycle.own>>
				You already have a high-end bike.
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $bicycle.quality lt 2>>
				<<if $money gte 100000>>
					<<bikeicon>><<link [[Purchase an intermediate bike (£1000 0:05)|Bike Depot]]>><<pass 5>><<set $phase to 2>><<set $bicycle.quality to 2>><<set $bicycle.durability.current to 6000>><<set $bicycle.durability.max to $bicycle.durability.current>><<set $bicycle.location to "high">><<set $money -= 100000>><</link>>
				<<else>>
					<span class="red">You don't have the £1000 to purchase an intermediate bike.</span>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $bicycle.quality is 2 && $bicycle.own>>
				You already have an intermediate bike.
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $bicycle.own is "false">>
				<<if $money gte 50000>>
					<<bikeicon>><<link [[Purchase a basic bike (£500 0:05)|Bike Depot]]>><<pass 5>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $bicycle.quality to 1>><<set $bicycle.durability.current to 3000>><<set $bicycle.durability.max to $bicycle.durability.current>><<set $bicycle.location to "high">><<set $money -= 50000>><</link>>
				<<else>>
					<span class="red">You don't have the £500 to purchase a basic bike.</span>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $bicycle.quality is 1 && $bicycle.own>>
				You already have a basic bike.
				<br>
			<</if>>			
			<<if $bicycle.theftEnabled && $bicycle.security lt 0.99>>
				<<bikeicon>><<link [[Browse through the security gear (0:05)|Bike Depot Security Gear]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $bicycle.own && $bicycle.upgrades.length lt 6>>
				<<bikeicon>><<link [[Browse through the off-road upgrades (0:05)|Bike Depot Off-Road]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if ($bicycle.own && ($bicycle.durability.current < $bicycle.durability.max))>>
				<<if $bicycle.durability.repair is undefined>><<generate1>><<person1>>
					<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte 600 || currentSkillValue('science') gte 600>>
						<<set $bicycle.durability.repair to 1>><br>
						The employee lingering at the register studies you and your beat up bike for a moment.
						<br><br>
						"You look like you might know your way around a tool or two. How about I sell you some kits so you can make small repairs yourself? You know, for emergencies."
						<br><br>
						<<He>> hands you a small bundle before you can respond, "Here's a freebie on the house. Don't waste it."
						<br><br>
						<span class="blue">The employees recognize your skill and have decided selling tools to you wouldn't be the biggest mistake in the world. Don't make them regret it.</span>
						<br><br>
					<<else>>
						The <<personsimple>> lingering at the register studies you and your beat up bike for a moment.
						<br><br>
						<<He>> appears unimpressed and continues working. <span class="blue">You might impress if you knew more about science, or were more deft with your hands.</span>
					<</if>>
					<<endevent>>
				<</if>>
				<<if $money gte 20000>>
					<<bikeicon>><<link [[Repair your bike (£200 0:20)|Bike Depot]]>><<pass 20>><<set $bicycle.location to "high">><<set $phase to 4>><</link>>
				<<else>>
					You don't have the £200 to repair your bike.
				<</if>>
				<<if $bicycle.durability.repair isnot undefined>>
					<br>
					<<if $bicycle.durability.repair lt 5>>
						<<if $money gte 500>>
							<<birdicon "tools">><<link [[Purchase a repair kit (£50 0:05)|Bike Depot]]>><<pass 5>><<set $bicycle.durability.repair++>><<set $phase to 5>><</link>>
						<<else>>
							You don't have the £50 to buy a repair kit.
						<</if>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Shopping Centre]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Bike Depot Security Gear
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "shopping_centre">><<effects>>

You browse through the selection of security gears.
<br><br>

<<if $bicycle.security lt 0.99>>
	<<if $money gte 100000>>
		<<link [[Purchase U-Lock with Alarm (£1000)|Bike Depot]]>><<set $money -= 100000>><<set $bicycle.security to 0.99>><</link>><<note "99.9% theft prevention">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £1000 to purchase a U-Lock with Alarm.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bicycle.security is 0.99>>
	You already have a U-Lock with Alarm.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $bicycle.security lt 0.8>>
	<<if $money gte 75000>>
		<<link [[Purchase U-Lock (£750)|Bike Depot]]>><<set $money -= 75000>><<set $bicycle.security to 0.8>><</link>><<note "80% theft prevention">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £750 to purchase a U-Lock.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bicycle.security is 0.8>>
	You already have a U-Lock.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $bicycle.security lt 0.5>>
	<<if $money gte 50000>>
		<<link [[Purchase Heavy-Duty Chain Lock with Hardened Steel (£500)|Bike Depot]]>><<set $money -= 50000>><<set $bicycle.security to 0.5>><</link>><<note "50% theft prevention">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £500 to purchase a heavy-duty chain lock with hardnened steel.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bicycle.security is 0.5>>
	You already have a Heavy-Duty Chain Lock with Hardened Steel.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $bicycle.security lt 0.3>>
	<<if $money gte 25000>>
		<<link [[Purchase Standard Chain Lock (£250)|Bike Depot]]>><<set $money -= 25000>><<set $bicycle.security to 0.3>><</link>><<note "30% theft prevention">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £250 to purchase a standard chain lock.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bicycle.security is 0.3>>
	You already have a Standard Chain Lock.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $bicycle.security lt 0.1>>
	<<if $money gte 10000>>
		<<link [[Purchase Wheel Lock (£100)|Bike Depot]]>><<set $money -= 10000>><<set $bicycle.security to 0.1>><</link>><<note "10% theft prevention">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £100 to purchase a wheel lock.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bicycle.security is 0.1>>
	You already have a Wheel Lock.
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Back|Bike Depot]]>><</link>>

:: Bike Depot Off-Road
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "shopping_centre">><<effects>>

You browse through the selection of Off-Road upgrades.
<br><br>

<<if !$bicycle.upgrades.suspension>>
	<<if $money gte 60000>>
		<<link [[Suspension fork (£600)|Bike Depot Off-Road]]>><<set $money -= 60000>><<set $bicycle.upgrades.pushUnique("suspension")>><</link>><<note "-10% travel time and -25% durability loss in Rough Terrain">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £600 to upgrade your suspension fork.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You already have a high-quality air fork.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !$bicycle.upgrades.tyres>>
	<<if $money gte 10000>>
		<<link [[Wider tyres with tread (£100)|Bike Depot Off-Road]]>><<set $money -= 10000>><<set $bicycle.upgrades.pushUnique("tyres")>><</link>><<note "-5% travel time and -15% durability loss in Rough Terrain">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £100 to upgrade your tyres.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You already have durable off-road tyres.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !$bicycle.upgrades.tubeless>>
	<<if $money gte 10000>>
		<<link [[Tubeless Setup (£100)|Bike Depot Off-Road]]>><<set $money -= 10000>><<set $bicycle.upgrades.pushUnique("tubeless")>><</link>><<note "-5% travel time and -10% durability loss in Rough Terrain">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £100 to upgrade to a tubeless setup.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You already have a tubeless setup.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !$bicycle.upgrades.brakes>>
	<<if $money gte 30000>>
		<<link [[Hydraulic Disk Brakes (£300)|Bike Depot Off-Road]]>><<set $money -= 30000>><<set $bicycle.upgrades.pushUnique("brakes")>><</link>><<note "-5% durability loss in Rough Terrain">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £300 to upgrade your brakes.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You already have hydraulic disk brakes.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !$bicycle.upgrades.pedals>>
	<<if $money gte 8000>>
		<<link [[Grippy pedals (£80)|Bike Depot Off-Road]]>><<set $money -= 8000>><<set $bicycle.upgrades.pushUnique("pedals")>><</link>><<note "-2.5% travel time and -5% durability loss in Rough Terrain">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £80 to upgrade your pedals.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You already have flat grippy pedals.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !$bicycle.upgrades.grips>>
	<<if $money gte 6000>>
		<<link [[Ergonomic grips and bar ends (£60)|Bike Depot Off-Road]]>><<set $money -= 6000>><<set $bicycle.upgrades.pushUnique("grips")>><</link>><<note "-2.5% travel time and -5% durability loss in Rough Terrain">>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You don't have the £60 to upgrade your cockpit.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You already have ergonomic grips and bar ends.
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Back|Bike Depot]]>><</link>>
